# Most Important Advice

Do NOT try to memorize architectures.

Instead:

* understand bottlenecks
* understand tradeoffs
* understand failures
* understand scaling patterns

Senior engineers think in:

* latency
* throughput
* consistency
* fault tolerance
* operational complexity

